<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 TƐSALONIKAFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tɛsalonikafoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Tɛsalonikafoɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">TƐSALONIKAFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ OLI MOA</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne ba awieɛ ne, yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa he mane asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Tɛsalonika ne. Wɔ sɔ akwanduo nanu ne, ɔhɔle Tɛsalonika, na ɔfale homeda nza hane nzɛmba ne wɔ berɛ. Wangyɛ biala, benyane asafo wɔ berɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ahyɛaseɛ ne, asafo bɔ ne ɔwɔ berɛ ne yiale ɔtaeɛ paa. Atuturafoɛ biemɔ tuli bɛ nye siele Paul ne Silas ne asafo bɔ bate ye foforɛ naso, yeti aliemaa nemɔ fale bɛ fili berɛ hɔle Berea, ebia bɛhɔle kɔngɔen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔbɔ bɛ nwo waen ɔ. Yesi ne, Paul bɔle mmɔden pɛn nyɔ kyɛ ɔkɔwa Tɛsalonika, nakoso Satan sili ye atee. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:18">1Tɛ 2:18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔnate kyɛ Paul anya atee angɔ berɛ nati, ɔsomane Timoteo kyɛ ɔɔnea bɛ boso, ɔhyɛ bɛ nguraen, na ɔkyekye bɛ wora. Mmerɛ bɔ Timoteo wale ne, ɔfale edwirɛ pa brɛle Paul, yeti yeɛ ɔhworɔle sɔ krataa he mane bɛ ne. Na ɔhworɔle ye kɔyɛ afoɛ 50 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔwɔ Korinto. Ye krataa nanu ne, ɔkamvole bɛ, ɔhyɛle bɛ nguraen, na osa tuli bɛ fo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔ sɔ krataa he anu ne, Somafoɛ Paul hane mbaeɛ nwo dwirɛ paa, ɔne bɛbɔ bɛboka ye so ne bɔle mbaeɛ mane Tɛsalonikafoɛ nemɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2">1Tɛ 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:13">2:13</ref></char>), na ɔhyɛle bɛ ngunaen kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ yakyi mbaebɔ lle” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:17-18">1Tɛ 5:17-18</ref></char>), na osa hane kyɛ: “Aliemaa mɔ, yɛ koso, ɛmɔ bɔ mbaeɛ bɛma yɛ” —<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:25">1Tɛ 5:25</ref>. </char></para>
  <para style="ip">Gyidie, ɔdɔ ne anidasoɛ bɔ ne bɛle ye ne, Paul kamvole bɛ wɔ nwo; na ɔhane kyɛ bɛhɔ so bɛla sɔ suban nemɔ ali. —<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">1Tɛ 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:10-12">3:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">5:8</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tɛsalonikafoɛ ne gyidie ti, ɔda Nyameɛ ase (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-10">1:2-10</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔsom adwuma bɔ Paul yɛle ye wɔ Tɛsalonika (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tɛsalonikafoɛ lɛle Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:13-16">2:13-16</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul afe Tɛsalonikafoɛ nemɔ; ɔpena kyɛ onwu bɛ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:17-20">2:17-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul nwondɛle wɔ Atene (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 3:1-5">3:1-5</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Amaneɛ bɔ Timoteo fa wale ne maa b'ahone tɔle bɛ kunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 3:6-10">3:6-10</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛbɔle mbaeɛ bɛmane Tɛsalonikafoɛ nemɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 3:11-13">3:11-13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adwamammɔ nwo kɔkɔbɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-8">4:1-8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Krataa he fi Paul, Silwano,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ bɛfrɛ ye Silas ne.</char></note> ne Timoteo berɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">yɛfa yɛkɔma Tɛsalonika asafo bɔ bɛne Baba Nyameɛ ne Awurade Yesu Kristo ayɛ kõ ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Adom ne asomdwie ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Mmerɛ biala bɔ yɛkɔbɔ ɛmɔ mukoraati dumaa wɔ yɛ mbaeɛ nu ne, ɛyɛ a yɛda Nyameɛ ase daa, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />ofikyɛ yɛkaye adwuma bɔ ɛmɔ yɛle ye wɔ gyidie nu, adwuma serɛ bɔ ɛmɔ yɛle ye wɔ ɔdɔ nu, ɔne animia bɔ ɛmɔfa begyina ɔhaw nu, ɔnate anidasoɛ bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ y'Awurade Kristo Yesu nu wɔ yɛ Baba ne yɛ Nyameɛ nyunu ne. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Aliemaa mɔ bɔ Nyameɛ dɔ ɛmɔ, yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ waye ɛmɔ ɔ, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ofikyɛ nná yɛ noa ngome yeɛ yɛfa yɛhane nzɛmba ne yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom yɛfale tumi, honhom krongron, ne gyidie bɔ enu yɛ se yɛbokale so. Na mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ nwuni kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ ti, né yɛbɔ yɛ bra ne. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ɛmɔ suesuane yɛ, yeɛ ɛmɔ suesuane Awurade, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ fale anigye bɔ honhom krongron ne fa mane ɛmɔ ne bɛlɛle edwirɛ ne wɔ amanehunu pee nu. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Yeti ɛmɔ ayɛ nneasoɛ pa bama gyidifoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Makedonia ne Akaia namukoraati. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ofikyɛ nná Awurade dwirɛ ne ngome yeɛ watrɛ wafi ɛmɔ berɛ wahɔ Makedonia ne Akaia ɔ, mmom gyidie bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ Nyameɛ nu ne adwu nekaa biala, yeti ye nwo nhia kyɛ yɛka edwirɛ biala. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔbɔ bɛka mmerɛ bɔ yɛli moa yɛ wale ɛmɔ berɛ nanwo dwirɛ, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ yakyile ɛmɔ statu <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bosoen.”</char></note> nemɔ berɛ bɛwale Nyameɛ berɛ, kyɛ ɛmɔ baasõ Nyameɛ teasefoɛ komapɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ ne, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ná ɛmɔ nwondɛ kyɛ Ɔwa bɔ otingyele ye fili ewue nu ne kofi anwuro kɔwa, ye yeɛ ole Yesu bɔ odɛ́ yɛ fi ɛyaa bɔ ɔba nanu ne.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse kyɛ, ɛwalɛ bɔ yɛwale ɛmɔ berɛ ne, wanyɛ mbaen. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Kyɛbɔ ɛmɔse ne, yɛli moa yɛnwuni amaneɛ, na bɛbɔle yɛ alapaa wɔ Filipi. Nakoso, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ né mmenia dwɔso tia yɛ ne, Nyameɛ mane yɛ akukuduro maa yɛhane nzɛmba ne yɛhyirele ɛmɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Na afutuo bɔ yɛfa yɛmane ɛmɔ ne, oggyi ngondombo dwirɛ, nikye bɔ ye nwo nde, anaa nnaka-naka biala so, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />mmom Nyameɛ alɛ́ yɛ ato nu kyɛ yɛfata, na wafa nzɛmba ne wawura yɛ sa, yeti sɛ yɛdwudwo a, yɛmva yɛnzɔ sona nye, mmom yɛfa yɛsɔ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔneɛnea y'ahone nu ne nye. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔse kyɛ yanga edwirɛ biala yanlaka-laka ɛmɔ, na yamva atee biala so yannidi ɛmɔ nwo lle. Nyameɛ di ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Na sɔ ala koso yeɛ yambena sona nyunu anuonyam biala wɔ ɛmɔ ne afoforɛ berɛ, ɔwɔ nu, Kristo asomafoɛ de, né ahaa yɛkɔhora yɛkɔfa yɛ haw yɛkogua ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Nakoso, mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, yɛkrɔkrɔle ɛmɔ te kyɛ bɔ brataen yɛ ye mmaa ne. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Na ɔnate kyɛ yɛkuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ nati, nná Nyameɛ dwirɛ na ngome yeɛ yɛyerele yɛ nwo yɛha yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom yɛhuni yɛ nwo yɛmane ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ né yɛkuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ paa.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Aliemaa mɔ, medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛmɔkaye adwuma serɛ bɔ yɛyɛle, ɔne fɛɛ bɔ yɛfɛle ne. Né yɛyɛ adwuma kɔngɔen ne eyia, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛngɔfa adesoa biala yɛngɔto ɛmɔ so mmerɛ bɔ yɛka Nyameɛ nzɛmba ne yɛkyire ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ɛmɔdi adanzeɛ, na Nyameɛ koso di adanzeɛ kyɛ, né yɛdi nahorɛ, yɛte ateneneefoɛ, na né edwirɛ biala nne yɛ nwo wɔ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte gyidifoɛ nanu. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ɛmɔse ye paa kyɛ, yɛtule ɛmɔ fo, yɛkyekyele ɛmɔ wora, na yɛlili ɛmɔ nu biala adanzeɛ kyɛbɔ baba yɛ ye mmaa mɔ ne, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔhɔ so bɛkɔbɔ bra bɔ ɔfata Nyameɛ bɔ ɔfrɛ ɛmɔ ba ye Ahennie ne ye anuonyam nu ne.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ yɛ koso, daa yɛda Nyameɛ ase ne, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔlɛle Nyameɛ dwirɛ bɔ yɛha yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔ annɛ ye kyɛ sona dwirɛ, mmom ɛmɔlɛle ye kyɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ, na sɔ ala yeɛ te ɔ; na ɛhene yeɛ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔte gyidifoɛ nanu ne. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ suesuane Nyameɛ asafo ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Kristo Yesu nu wɔ Yudea ne, ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ nwuni amaneɛ wɔ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ mmenia sa nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ koso bɛnwuni amaneɛ wɔ Yudafoɛ sa nu ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Yudafoɛ hemɔ yeɛ bɛhuni Awurade Yesu ne adiifoɛ nemɔ ne, na bɛ ala yeɛ bɛtane yɛ nye ne. Afei koso, bɛnyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye, na bɛdwɔso betia sona ebiala, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ofikyɛ né bɛpena kyɛ bɛsi yɛ atee, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛngɔha edwirɛ ne yɛngohyire maen-maen, ná wamaa balɛ́ bɛ ngoa. Bɛyɛ sɔ ne, né bɛ bɔne ne sone, na ye yaa awa bɛ so.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nakoso aliemaa mɔ, mmerɛ bɔ yɛfili ɛmɔ nwo kaa (wɔ anwoɔnaen nu, nná ahone nu) ne, ɔnate kyɛ né yafe ɛmɔ paa nati, yɛyɛle bɔ yɛkɔhora biala kyɛ yɛ konwu ɛmɔ nyunu. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Yeti, né yɛpena kyɛ yɛba ɛmɔ berɛ, me Paul po de, mmɔle mmɔden pɛn nyɔ kyɛ ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, nakoso Abɔnzam sili me atee. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Sɛ y'Awurade Yesu ba a, nzu yeɛ ɔte y'anidasoɛ, y'anigye, anaa y'abotire bɔ yɛkɔfa yɛkɔ-hoɔhoa yɛ nwo ɔ? Nná ɛmɔ? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Amba, ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔte y'anuonyam ne y'anigye ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Afei de, né yɛngora nwondɛ kõ, yeti né yɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ yɛ ngome yɛkɔtena Atene.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Atense”</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Na yɛsomane Timoteo, bɔ ɔte yɛliema ne Nyameɛ somvoɛ wɔ Kristo nwo nzɛmba nanu ne kyɛ ɔɔhyɛ ɛmɔ nguraen, na ɔma ɛmɔ gyidie yɛ se, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, amaneɛ bɔ ɛmɔnwu ye ne nngɔma ebiala nngɔ hinhim. Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔse kyɛ, odikyɛ yɛnwu sɔ amaneɛ ne. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, né yɛtaa yɛka yɛkyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, yekonwu amaneɛ, na kyɛbɔ ɛmɔse ne, ye yeɛ wawa nu ne. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ɛhe ati, mmerɛ bɔ ne mengora nwondɛ kõ ne, nzomane Timoteo kyɛ ɔɔnea kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ gyidie ne te ɔ, ofikyɛ ebia né bɔ ɔsɔ mmenia nea ne asɔ ɛmɔ anea, maa yɛ fɛɛ ayɛ mbaen.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Nakoso afei de, Timoteo afi ɛmɔ berɛ waadwu yɛ wa, na waha ɛmɔ gyidie ne ɛmɔ dɔ nanwo dwirɛ pa wahyire yɛ, na wamaa yanwu kyɛ, daa ɛmɔkaye yɛ paa, na kyɛbɔ yafe ɛmɔ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ afe yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, mmerɛ bɔ yɛtele nahorɛ bɔ ɛmɔdi nanwo dwirɛ ne, y'ahone atɔ yɛ kunu wɔ y'ahokyere ne amanehunu nu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ofikyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔgyina pindinn wɔ Awurade nu a, yɛnya anwoserɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Anigye nwora bɔ ɛmɔ ama yanya ye wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu ne, nzu po yeɛ yɛfa yɛla Nyameɛ ase ɔ? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Yeti, eyia ne kɔngɔen biala, yɛsrɛ ye paa kyɛ ɔma yɛnwu ɛmɔ nyunu, na nekaa bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie ne atɔ si ne, yapagya nu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Kesaalae de, yɛsrɛ yɛ Nyameɛ ne yɛ Baba ne bɔbɔ, ne y'Awurade Yesu kyɛ, bɛbukye atee maa yɛbra ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Afei koso, Awurade ma ɛmɔ dɔ boso, ɔma ɛmɔnya ɔdɔ pee bɛma ɛmɔ nwo ne ebiala, kyɛbɔ yɛ koso yɛdɔ ɛmɔ ne, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ ahone kosi pi, na wayɛ krongron bɔ ngekayɛɛ biala nne ye nwo wɔ yɛ Nyameɛ ne yɛ Baba ne nyunu, mmerɛ bɔ y'Awurade Yesu kɔwa bɔ ye akrongronfoɛ namukoraati boka ye so ne.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, yɛmaa ɛmɔ nwuni kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ kɔbɔ ɛmɔ bra maa ɔkɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye, na sɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ. Yesa yɛsrɛ ɛmɔ, na yɛfa Awurade Yesu dumaa yɛpa ɛmɔ kyerɛ kyɛ, bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, ɛmɔyɛ ma ɔbo so. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ná ɛmɔse akwankyerɛ bɔ yɛnate Awurade Yesu so yɛfa yɛmane ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ɛhe: kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ krongron,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ nwo te.”</char></note> na ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi adwamammɔ nwo. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Na odikyɛ ɛmɔ nu biala nwu kyɛbɔ ɔkɔhyɛ ye nipadua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nt., “Anwenneɛ”</char></note> so wɔ ahoteɛ ne nidie nu, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />na ɔnzɛ kyɛ ɛmɔma nnaa nwo akɔnnɔ bɔ yenoa yɛ se hyɛ ɛmɔ so, kyɛbɔ maen-maen bɔ bɛnze Nyameɛ ne yɛ ne. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Na nnɛmaa ebiala yɛ ye nikye maa ɔbo so, ná ɔyɛ oliema aborɛ wɔ ɛhe anwo, ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ yɛli moa yɛhane ye nwo dwirɛ yɛhyirele ɛmɔ, na yɛbɔle ɛmɔ kɔkɔ kitii ne, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ nningyein, Awurade kɔhwe bɛ so. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ amvrɛ yɛ kyɛ yɛɛbɔ bra-bɔne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bra fiɛ.”</char></note> mmom ahoteɛ ti yeɛ ɔfrɛle yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Na ebiala bɔ okobu ngyerɛkyerɛ he animtia ne, nná sona yeɛ wabu ye animtia ɔ, mmom Nyameɛ bɔ ɔfale ye honhom krongron mane ɛmɔ ne yeɛ wabu ye animtia ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Na ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔ kɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo ne de, ye nwo nhia kyɛ yɛtworɔ ye nwo dwirɛ biala yɛbrɛ ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ bɔbɔ ahyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ná amba-ne-amba, ɛmɔdɔ aliemaa mɔ bɛ bɛwɔ Makedonia nekaa biala ne. Nakoso aliemaa mɔ, yɛsrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔyɛ ye pee. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔtena berɛ konn, ɛmɔ koli ɛmɔ awuro dwirɛ, na ɛmɔ afa ɛmɔ sa bayɛ adwuma kyɛbɔ yɛ hyirele ɛmɔ nala, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />na ɛmɔ abɔ bra pa maa bɛ bɔ benne asafo nanu ne anwu ye, na nikye fee anhia ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, bɛ bɔ badeda wɔ ewue nu ne, yɛnguro kyɛ bɛ nwo dwirɛ kɔfea ɛmɔ, na ɛmɔ anni aworaborɛ maa wammo so, kyɛbɔ bɛ bɔ baha bɔ bɛlle anidasoɛ biala ne yɛ ne. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Na sɛ yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ Yesu wuli, na osa tingyele de a, ye de yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ Nyameɛ nate Yesu so kɔfa bɛ bɔ badeda<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bawuwu”</char></note> wɔ ye nu ne kɔwa. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Bɔ yɛnate Awurade dwirɛ so yɛka yɛkyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛbɔ yɛte ase ne, sɛ yɛtena ase yɛkodwu mmerɛ bɔ Awurade kɔwa ne a, yɛngoli bɛ bɔ bawuwu<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Badeda.”</char></note> ne nyunu lle, <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />ofikyɛ Awurade bɔbɔ kɔfa konviɛ bɔ yenoa yɛ se, abɔfo panyi konvi, ne Nyameɛ awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> kodwu, na bɛ bɔ bɛwuli wɔ Kristo nu ne koli moa kɔdwɔso. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ɛhene si ne, yɛbɔ yaha bɔ yɛte ase ne, bɛkɔfa yɛne bɛ mukoraati wɔ munungum nu maa yɛkooyia Awurade wɔ ewienu, na yɛne Awurade kɔtena daa.<verse eid="1TH 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Yeti, ɛmɔfa sɔ dwirɛ he bɛhyehyɛ ɛmɔ nwo nguraen.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, mmerɛ ne ngyẽa ne de, ye nwo nhia kyɛ yɛtworɔ nikye biala wɔ ye nwo yɛberɛ ɛmɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ, ɛmɔse ye paa kyɛ, Awurade kyẽa ne kɔwa kyɛbɔ awieniɛ ba kɔngɔen ne. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Sɛ benya bɛka kyɛ yanya “Asomdwie ne ahotɔ” a, mvum nu yeɛ bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ komapɛ, kyɛbɔ aworɛ ka brasua bɔ ɔnwonzɛ ne, na bɛngɔhora nwati. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Nakoso aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnne awosii nu, né sɔ kyẽa ne afu ɛmɔ nu kyɛ awieniɛ, <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔte kanea ne aleheneɛ mmaa. Yɛtte kɔngɔen anaa awosii deɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa yɛda, kyɛbɔ bɛ bɔ baha ne da ne, mmom, ɛmɔma yɛnea yé,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛnwɛne; Yɛtingye.”</char></note> na yɛ nye la berɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛda ne da kɔngɔen, na bɛ bɔ bɛbo ne bo kɔngɔen. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Nakoso yɛ de, yɛte aleheneɛ mmaa, yeti ɛmɔma yɛ nye la berɛ, na yɛfa gyidie ne ɔdɔ yɛyɛ buralɛ yɛkata yɛ hue so, na yɛfa daa ngoa nwo anidasoɛ ne yɛyɛ buralɛ kyerɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ anye yɛ kyɛ ɔbaahwe yɛ so, mmom ɔyele yɛ kyɛ yɛfa Awurade Kristo Yesu so yɛnya ngoa. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Owu mane yɛ, yeti sɛ yɛte ase<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛ llale.”</char></note> oo, sɛ yawu<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yala.”</char></note> oo, yɛne ye kɔtena ngoa nu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Yeti, ɛmɔ hyehyɛ ɛmɔ nwo nguraen, na ɛmɔboka-boka ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔyɛ nala.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Aliemaa mɔ, yɛsrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔfa obuo bɛma bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma serɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na bɛdi ɛmɔ nyunu wɔ Awurade nu bɛtu ɛmɔ fo ne, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />adwuma bɔ bɛyɛ nati, ɛmɔfa nidie bɔ ɔkɔ siɛ bɛma bɛ, na ɛmɔlɔ bɛ. Ɛmɔ ne ɛmɔ nwo tena asomdwie nu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, yɛtu ɛmɔ fo kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛnate basabasa ne, ɛmɔbɔ bɛ kɔkɔ, ɛmɔkyekye bɛ bɔ b'abanu abu né wora, ɛmɔboka bɛ bɔ bayɛ mmerɛ ne, ɛmɔnya sona biala nwo aboterɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ɛmɔnea kyɛ ebiala ngɔfa bɔne ngotua ye mmango bɔne so kerɛ, mmom ebiala yɛ bɔ ɔte pa ma ye mmango ne mmenia bɔ baha namukoraati. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ɛmɔli ahurusi daa. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Nnɛmɔ yakyi mbaebɔ lle. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Nikye biala nu, ɛmɔla Nyameɛ ase, ofikyɛ ɛhe yeɛ Nyameɛ pena kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Nnɛmɔ nua honhom ne see ne. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Nnɛmɔbu ngɔmhyɛ animtia, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />mmom ɛmɔsɔ nikye biala bɛnea, na bɔ ɔte pa ne, ɛmɔsɔ nu yé. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi bɔne biala nwo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Yɛsrɛ kyɛ asomdwie Nyameɛ ne te ɛmɔ nwo koraa, na ɔnea ɛmɔ honhom, ɛmɔ kra, ne ɛmɔ nipadua bɔ dɛm nne ye nwo naso yé, na edwirɛ biala amma ɛmɔ nwo mmerɛ bɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo kɔwa ne. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Bɔ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ ne di nahorɛ, na kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ɔkɔyɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Aliemaa mɔ, yɛ koso, ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ɛmɔfa mveanoɛ bɔ ɔte krongron bɛhyeɛhyea aliemaa mɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mehyɛ ɛmɔ kitii wɔ Awurade nu kyɛ, ɛmɔkenga krataa he behyire aliemaa mɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom ha ɛmɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>